        "text": "=Analyze the following meeting transcript.\n\nYour job is to:\n\n1. Generate a short, descriptive title for the meeting based on the main topic discussed.\n2. Create a concise and accurate meeting summary.\n3. Extract every actionable task from the meeting.\n4. Identify the person responsible for each task.\n5. Identify the deadline if one is mentioned.\n6. If a person or deadline is not mentioned, write \"Not specified\".\n7. Do not invent information.\n8. Return the information according to the required output structure.\n\nMeeting transcript:\n\n{{ $json.body.transcript }}",
